## Worth considering
- Frontend has no test infrastructure at all (`frontend/package.json` has no `test` script, no test files anywhere in the repo) despite `CLAUDE.md` documenting `npm test`. This is a pre-existing, project-wide gap — not introduced or worsened by this diff — and was already noted as out-of-scope in the design stage's precedent (the priority feature shipped the same way). Not this cycle's responsibility to fix.

